<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-Hant">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>社群熱門 · {{ meta.date }}</title>
<meta name="description" content="{{ meta.date }} 社群熱門：台灣即時熱搜 {{ d.trends | length }} 則、網路溫度計 {{ d.dailyview | length }} 篇、台灣社群排行 {{ d.boards | length }} 平台、Bluesky 話題 {{ d.bsky_trends | length }} 個、AI 貼文 {{ d.bsky_posts | length }} 篇。">
{% include "_style.html.j2" %}
</head>
<body>
<div class="wrap">
{% include "_sections.html.j2" %}
<header>
  <h1><a href="{{ root }}social/index.html">社群熱門</a></h1>
  <div class="meta">
    <span>{{ meta.date }}</span>
    <span>{{ d.trends | length }} 熱搜 · {{ d.dailyview | length }} 溫度計 · {{ d.boards | length }} 平台排行 · {{ d.bsky_trends | length }} 話題 · {{ d.bsky_posts | length }} 貼文</span>
    <span>收錄近 {{ meta.window_hours }} 小時</span>
    <span>更新於 {{ meta.generated_at | localtime(tz) }}</span>
    <a href="{{ root }}social/archive/index.html">歷史存檔</a>
  </div>
</header>

<nav class="tabs" aria-label="區塊">
  <a href="#tw">台灣即時熱搜<b>{{ d.trends | length }}</b></a>
  {% if d.dailyview %}<a href="#dv">網路溫度計<b>{{ d.dailyview | length }}</b></a>{% endif %}
  {% if d.boards %}<a href="#boards">台灣社群排行<b>{{ d.boards | length }}</b></a>{% endif %}
  <a href="#bsky">Bluesky 熱門話題<b>{{ d.bsky_trends | length }}</b></a>
  <a href="#posts">AI 熱門貼文<b>{{ d.bsky_posts | length }}</b></a>
</nav>

{% if not d.trends and not d.bsky_trends and not d.bsky_posts %}
<div class="empty">今天沒有抓到社群熱門資料。</div>
{% endif %}

{% if d.trends %}
<h2 class="cat" id="tw">台灣即時熱搜</h2>
<section class="briefs compact">
  {% for t in d.trends %}
  <article class="brief">
    {% if t.image %}
    <a class="brief-hero" href="{{ t.url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
      <img src="{{ '' if t.image.startswith('http') else root }}{{ t.image }}"
           alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"
           onerror="this.parentNode.classList.add('broken'); this.remove()">
      <span class="brief-tag">{{ loop.index }}</span>
      {% if t.traffic %}<span class="trend-rank">{{ t.traffic }} 次搜尋</span>{% endif %}
    </a>
    {% endif %}
    <div class="brief-body">
      {% if not t.image %}<span class="brief-tag plain">{{ loop.index }}</span>{% endif %}
      <h3 class="brief-lead">
        <a href="{{ t.url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">{{ t.title }}</a>
      </h3>
      {% if not t.image and t.traffic %}<p class="trend-meta">{{ t.traffic }} 次搜尋</p>{% endif %}
      {% if t.news %}
      <ul class="brief-list">
        {% for n in t.news %}
        <li>
          <a href="{{ n.url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">{{ n.title }}</a>
          {% if n.source %}<div class="post-who">{{ n.source }}</div>{% endif %}
        </li>
        {% endfor %}
      </ul>
      {% else %}
      <p class="trend-meta">（這個熱搜目前沒有相關新聞）</p>
      {% endif %}
    </div>
  </article>
  {% endfor %}
</section>
{% endif %}

{% if d.dailyview %}
<h2 class="cat" id="dv">網路溫度計 熱門話題</h2>
<section class="briefs compact">
  {% for a in d.dailyview %}
  <article class="brief">
    {% if a.image %}
    <a class="brief-hero" href="{{ a.url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
      <img src="{{ '' if a.image.startswith('http') else root }}{{ a.image }}"
           alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"
           onerror="this.parentNode.classList.add('broken'); this.remove()">
      {% if a.category %}<span class="brief-tag">{{ a.category }}</span>{% endif %}
      {% if a.date %}<span class="trend-rank">{{ a.date }}</span>{% endif %}
    </a>
    {% endif %}
    <div class="brief-body">
      {% if not a.image and a.category %}<span class="brief-tag plain">{{ a.category }}</span>{% endif %}
      <h3 class="brief-lead">
        <a href="{{ a.url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">{{ a.title }}</a>
      </h3>
      {% if a.summary %}<p class="trend-meta">{{ a.summary }}</p>{% endif %}
      {% if not a.image and a.date %}<p class="trend-meta">{{ a.date }}</p>{% endif %}
    </div>
  </article>
  {% endfor %}
</section>
{% endif %}

{% if d.boards %}
<h2 class="cat" id="boards">台灣社群排行</h2>
<p class="note">Social Lab（OpView 社群口碑資料庫）每週彙整各平台熱門事件。榜上的數據以圖表呈現，
  這裡列出每週彙整的標題與觀測期間，點進去看完整排行。</p>
<section class="briefs compact">
  {% for b in d.boards %}
  <article class="brief">
    {% if b.items and b.items[0].image %}
    <a class="brief-hero" href="{{ b.items[0].url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
      <img src="{{ '' if b.items[0].image.startswith('http') else root }}{{ b.items[0].image }}"
           alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"
           onerror="this.parentNode.classList.add('broken'); this.remove()">
      <span class="brief-tag">{{ b.platform }}</span>
    </a>
    {% endif %}
    <div class="brief-body">
      {% if not (b.items and b.items[0].image) %}<span class="brief-tag plain">{{ b.platform }}</span>{% endif %}
      <ul class="brief-list">
        {% for i in b.items %}
        <li>
          <a href="{{ i.url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">{{ i.title }}</a>
          {% if i.period %}<div class="post-who">{{ i.period }}</div>{% endif %}
        </li>
        {% endfor %}
      </ul>
      <a class="brief-more" href="{{ b.url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">{{ b.platform }}排行榜 →</a>
    </div>
  </article>
  {% endfor %}
</section>
{% endif %}

{% if d.bsky_trends %}
<h2 class="cat" id="bsky">Bluesky 熱門話題</h2>
<p class="note">Bluesky 的全站熱門話題，以英語圈的娛樂、體育、政治為主，僅供參考。</p>
<div class="pills">
  {% for t in d.bsky_trends %}
  <a class="pill{% if t.status == 'hot' %} hot{% endif %}" href="{{ t.url }}"
     target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
    <b>{% if t.status == 'hot' %}🔥 {% endif %}{{ t.topic }}</b>
    <span>{{ '{:,}'.format(t.post_count) }} 篇</span>
  </a>
  {% endfor %}
</div>
{% endif %}

{% if d.bsky_posts %}
<h2 class="cat" id="posts">AI 熱門貼文（Bluesky）</h2>
<p class="note">以 {{ meta.window_hours }} 小時內、依讚數與轉發數排序，已過濾掉 AI 繪圖標籤與明顯洗版內容。</p>
<ul class="posts">
  {% for p in d.bsky_posts %}
  <li class="post">
    <div class="post-body">
      <div class="post-who">
        <a href="https://bsky.app/profile/{{ p.handle }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">{{ p.display_name or p.handle }}</a>
        <span>@{{ p.handle }}</span>
        {% if p.created_at %}· {{ p.created_at | localtime(tz) }}{% endif %}
        {% if p.query %}· 命中「{{ p.query }}」{% endif %}
      </div>
      <p class="post-text">{{ p.text }}</p>
      <div class="post-stats">
        <span>♥ {{ '{:,}'.format(p.likes) }}</span>
        <span>↻ {{ '{:,}'.format(p.reposts) }}</span>
        <span>💬 {{ '{:,}'.format(p.replies) }}</span>
        {% if p.external %}<span>🔗 {{ p.external | domain }}</span>{% endif %}
        {% if p.url %}<a href="{{ p.url }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">看原文 →</a>{% endif %}
      </div>
    </div>
    {% if p.image %}
    <div class="post-thumb">
      <img src="{{ '' if p.image.startswith('http') else root }}{{ p.image }}"
           alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" referrerpolicy="no-referrer"
           onerror="this.parentNode.remove()">
    </div>
    {% endif %}
  </li>
  {% endfor %}
</ul>
{% endif %}

<footer>
  <div>由 <code>auto_report_news</code> 自動產生 · 熱搜來自 Google Trends（{{ meta.geo }}）、
    熱門話題來自網路溫度計 DailyView、平台排行來自 Social Lab（OpView）、
    話題與貼文來自 Bluesky 公開 API。</div>
  <div class="srcs">Threads 未納入：官方 API 沒有 trending 端點，且熱度數據（讚／回覆）只能讀自己的貼文，無法排序熱門。</div>
</footer>
</div>
</body>
</html>
